WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: kl

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.020
Hallo, tassaavoq Manner Code.

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:05.350
Software tassaavoq ajornakusoortoq

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:08.890
Siullermik kode-nik allanneqartariaqartunik amerlasuunik peqarpoq.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:12.710
Aamma assersuutigalugu projektit seriemut tassunga pilersippakka

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:15.270
Kode 12.000-it sinnerlugit takissuseqarpoq.

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:18.320
Ingerlatsinermi sullissineq ilumut tassaappat

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:21.530
Naak sullissineq mikisuugaluartoq, ajornanngitsumik 100.000-it qaangersinnaavaat.

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:25.300
Liniit hundrede tusind-it naammassisaqarluarput oqaluttualiat 20-t ulikkaarnissaannut.

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:29.560
Kode-mik sivisuumik allanniarneq isumaqanngilaq naammassisimasoq.

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.540
Kode-mik allassimasunik aaqqissuussisarnissaq ingerlateqqittariaqarpat.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.800
A-mik aaqqissuussiguit B-p aserorpaa.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:39.130
B-mik iluarsaassiguit A aamma C aseruuttoortussaapput.

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:44.260
Analogi atorlugu soorlu Rasputica-mi paarnaarussaaqqalluni qiarpalulluni.

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:46.360
Oqarsinnaavutit hiistimut assingusumik inissisimasoq.

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:50.550
Tassani misigissavat niuernermik pisariaqartitsineq.

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:55.010
Kisianni ilumut designdokumentimik allanniarsariguit,

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.490
Eqqarsaatit niaqqunniittut konkrete-mik ersersinniarlugit

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:01.260
Paasissavat isumaqarfigisatut ajornanngitsoq.

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:05.600
Naak noter, tassa allakkiaq nipimik nipilersornermilluunniit takussutissiamik immiussisartoq,

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:06.700
Tamanna pissanganartuuvoq

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:10.610
Nipilersorneq kisiat pinnagu aamma aningaasaqarneq logistikkilu

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:14.060
Assigiinngisitsinerusut isumassarsiat aamma abstrakte atuisunut piumasaqaatit

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:17.220
Immikkut ittumik modelimi ersersinnissaa ajornanngilaq.

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:19.490
Ajoraluartumik

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:23.200
Abstrakte isumassarsiat modellernissaannut ajornartorsiut qaangerniarlugu

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:26.860
UML 1990-ikkunni kingullerni inunngorpoq.

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:30.120
Taanna Grady Butch-imit aqunneqarpoq.

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:34.390
UML atortarparput neriuuteqarluta

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:36.990
Klassimik diagrammik titartakkit

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:38.760
Aammattaaq sekvensdiagrammimik titartaavugut

00:01:39.430 --> 00:01:39.980
qanorluunniit

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:43.160
Ilumut designerniarlugu misiliigama, taanna allaaneruvoq toqqaannartumik kode-lernermit.

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.130
Assigiinngilluinnartutut isikkoqanngilaq

00:01:45.590 --> 00:01:46.520
Sooq taamaappa?

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:50.910
Tassami eqqarsartaatsip atuutsinneqarneranut ileqquuvoq.

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:54.170
Abstrakte isumassarsiat konkretinngortinniarlugit,

00:01:54.490 --> 00:01:57.590
Pissutigalugu implementeringsniveau-mik eqqarsarneq UML-imut nutserneqartarmat.

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:00.270
Pissutigalugu noter atuarsinnaagakku

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:01.950
Soorlu uanga taanna erinarsorsinnaanngilara

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:03.850
UML-imik ilinniarsimanerit pissutigalugu

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:06.170
Soorlu designimik piginnaasanik ineriartortitsisarneq.

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:09.300
Taamaattumik seriemi tassani

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:11.580
Suliniutit ilumoortut aqqutigalugit

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:14.420
Abstrakte piumasaqaatit qanoq konkretiserineqarsinnaanersut

00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:16.290
Kode-mik attaveqarsinnaavit?

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:18.010
Uanga nammineq takutikkumaarpakkit

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:20.930
Filmimut billetsinik domæne atorlugu inniminniinissaq toqqarpara

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:25.200
Filmimut billetsinut inniminniinerit paasineqarsinnaapput, tassami taakku annertuumik ilisimaneqarluartumik domæneqarmata.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:29.710
Ilaatigut suliassat assigiinngitsut soorlu isernissaq, akiliinissaq, aamma issiavimmik toqqaanissaq.

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:31.580
Assersuutissatut pitsaasutut isigineqartarpoq

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:36.890
Tunngaviusumik allaaserisami matumani sammisaq tassaavoq softwaremik suliaqarneq, kisianni...

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:40.350
Aamma misileraalluni ineriartortitsineq sammissavarput.

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:44.890
Ullumikkut ineriartortitsinermi avatangiisit misileraanermut atortut nunap inoqqaavisa tapersersorpaat.

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:48.320
Naak open source-imik suliassat tusaamasat qiviaraanni,

00:02:48.320 --> 00:02:51.130
Misilitsinnerup aalajangersimasup niveau-anik peqarpugut.

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:56.200
Tamanna isumaqarpoq misissuineq taama pingaaruteqartigisoq aammalu iluaqutaasinnaasoq.

00:02:56.870 --> 00:02:58.120
Kisianni ilumut

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:02.590
Amerlasuutigut TDD kisiat pinnagu, aammali misissuinermi automatisering eqqortumik atuutilersinneqanngilaq.

00:03:03.190 --> 00:03:06.260
Piareersarneq ajorlugu siullermik misilitsinnerit isumaqarluartunik allannissaat tassaavoq

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:07.540
Ajornanngilaq

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:12.340
Tamanna softwaremik suliaqarnermi ataatsimoorussamik piginnaasanik pisariaqartitsivoq.

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:16.270
Taava, pitsaaneruvoq design aamma TDD ataatsimoorlutik suliarinissaat.

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:18.180
Effektiviusutut nalilerpara

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:23.450
Taamaattumik maanna suliap ataatsimeersuarnera siulleq aallartissavarput.

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:26.470
Pissutigalugu tamanna suliassaq mikisoq

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:28.090
Peqataasut marluupput

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:32.340
Taanna talerperliup tungaaniittoq tassaavoq domæne-mik ilisimasalik, taannalu talerperliup tungaaniittoq tassaavoq ineriartortitsisoq.

00:03:34.550 --> 00:03:37.790
Domæne-mik ilisimasallit systemit sanaartortariaqarpagut oqaaseqarsinnaapput.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:39.280
Oqaluttuarpassuarnik oqaluttuarpoq

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:42.160
Teateri ingerlataraarput

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:44.710
Nuna tamakkerlugu taakku sisamat tusindit missaanniipput.

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:47.220
Siunissami suli annertunerulersinnaavoq.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:50.480
Ullumikkut filmimut billetsinut inniminniinermut atortoq kisimi tapersersorneqarpoq.

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:54.510
Annertuumik tusarnaartitsinernut billetsinik tuniniaaneq kingusinnerusukkut ilanngunneqarnissaa pilersaarutigaarput.

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:58.940
Aammalu pingaaruteqartoq tassaavoq issiaviit marloqiusamik booking-ertariaqanngitsutit.

00:03:58.940 --> 00:04:03.250
Siornatigut ataasiakkaanik sullissiviit taamatut ajornartorsiuteqarlutik ilumut ajornartorsiuteqarsimapput.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:07.670
Pissutigalugu filmimik paasissutissanik aammalu nalilersuinermik paasissutissanik katersorneqareersunik amerlasuunik peqarmat.

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:11.090
Paasissutissat taakku ataqqineqartussaapput.

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:14.730
Tassa oqallinneq aaqqissuulluagaalluni, kisianni

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:16.960
Ilumut paasissutissanik amerlanerusunik peqarpoq

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:18.600
Aaqqissuussaanngitsumik tunniunneqassaaq

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:22.110
Kisianni oqaluttuaq suliap aallartinnerani saqqummertoq tassaavoq

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:23.780
Pissutigalugu piumasaqaataavoq pingaarnerpaaq

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:25.320
Tusarnaarluartariaqarputit

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:29.810
Ineriartortitsisartut domænemik ilisimasallit tusarnaartarpaat

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:31.290
Arlalinnik apeqquteqarpunga

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.660
Annertuumik isiginnaartitsinermut billetsinut inniminniinermut funktioni eqqaamasat

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:36.910
Qanga ilanngunneqassava?

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:39.910
Tamanna suliap matuma annertussusaanut siusinnerusukkut ilanngunneqartariaqarpa?

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:43.590
Imaluunniit paaserusuppara suli eqqarsaatigisariaqaraluarlugu

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:46.090
Aammalu paasissutissat pioreersut pilersorneqarnissaat pisariaqartinneqartoq

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:48.940
Tamanna isumaqarpa DB-systemi allanngortittariaqanngikkatsigu?

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:51.950
Ullumikkut DB-mik avitseqatigiittartunik allanik sullissisoqarpa?

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:54.980
Soorlu DB-mi takusinnaagitsik,

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:57.290
Pissutigalugu domain-imik ilisimasallit ineriartortitsisuunngillat

00:04:57.290 --> 00:04:59.430
Teknikkikkut ersersitsineq marlunnik isumaqarpoq

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:02.890
Ineriartortitsisut tamakku peqqissaartumik misissoqqissaartariaqarpaat.

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:07.450
Domain-imi ilisimasallit ineriartortitsisut apeqqutaannut ima akisarpaat:

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:10.210
Annertuumik isiginnaartitsinermut billetsinut inniminniisarneq

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:13.450
Suli immikkut ittumik pilersaarusiortoqanngilaq.

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:15.970
Kisianni siunissami features-it ilanngunneqarpata

00:05:15.970 --> 00:05:18.700
Taamaalilluni annertuumik ajornartorsiuteqanngitsumik nutarterisinnaassallutit

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:22.600
Isumaqarpunga pitsaassasoq maannakkut eqqarsaatigisinnaagukku.

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:27.050
DB-mik sullissinerput allamut atortarparput.

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:32.840
Systemip nammineq allanngortinneqarnera annertuumik ajornartorsiutaanngilaq, paasissutissat pitsaasumik ingerlanneqarpata.

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:35.080
Oqaluttuaq tusareerlugu

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:39.400
Isumaqarpunga takutitsineq annertooq pillugu ernumasariaqanngitsut.

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:40.790
Suliniummi annertussuseq tassaanngilaq

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:43.040
Piumasaqaatit aamma ersarissuunngillat

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:44.930
Nalunngilara qaqugu pisariaqartitsissanerlunga, kisianni

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:47.710
Tassa ajornartorsiut kingusinnerusukkut nalilersortariaqassavarput.

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:50.910
Aamma allakkiami allassimanngikkaluartoq

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:54.880
Domæne-mik ilisimasallit aamma akissuteqartussaapput, annertuumik isiginnaartitsisarnissaq eqqarsaatigissagaat.

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:55.960
Illit puigortariaqanngilatit

00:05:56.740 --> 00:05:58.320
Ajunngilaq

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:00.630
Taava, annertuumik tusarnaartitsinermut billetsinut inniminniinermi funktion

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:04.500
Suliniummut tassunga pingaarnertut pingaarnertut ilaatinngilara.

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:08.220
Taarsiullugu ineriartortitsinermi kingusinnerusukkut funktionalitetimik annertusaanissaq ajornannginnerulersippaa.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.190
Taanna isumagilluarpara

00:06:10.190 --> 00:06:12.840
Ernumassanngilatit. Uanga kisimi upperiuk

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:15.960
Pingaaruteqarpoq isumaqatigiilluarnissaq

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:19.500
Manna tikillugu oqaloqatigiinnerput aqqutigalugu

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:22.700
Pingaarnertut qullerpaat imatut agguataarneqarput:

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:25.890
Tassa domænemik ilisimasallit paasissutissiissutigaat.

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:28.410
Ineriartortitsisup isiginnittaasianit oqariartuuteqarneq aaqqissuussinerlu

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:29.810
Suliniut aallartissavat

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:32.860
Domæne-mik ilisimasallit peqatigalugit

00:06:32.860 --> 00:06:34.980
Suliniummi anguniakkat aalajangersimagukkit,

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:37.980
Maanna piffissanngorpoq projektit taaguuteqartinnissaanut.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:41.840
Siullermik domæne-mik ilisimasalik isumassarsiaq aperiuk.

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:45.540
Suliniut qanoq ateqartariaqarpa?

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:47.680
Tassaavoq filminik inniminniinermik systemi.

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:50.150
Filminik Booking Systemi kisiat qanoq ippa?

00:06:50.150 --> 00:06:51.430
aap, piumanngilara

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:53.570
Isiginnaartitsinerit annertuut uanga isumagissavakka

00:06:53.570 --> 00:06:56.930
Filminik Booking System atorlugu ingerlaqqissaagut. Aap?

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:58.180
torrak

00:06:58.180 --> 00:06:59.950
Qujanarujussuaq

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:05.230
Domæne-mik ilisimasallit koreamiusut projektit aqqinik piumasaqarsinnaapput.

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:07.680
Kisianni ineriartortitsisup isiginnittaasianit

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:09.990
Taaguutit tamarmik ilaatigut projektit aqqi

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:12.180
Pissutigalugu kode-mi toqqaannartumik atuutilersinneqartarmat,

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:15.000
Pisinnaappat tuluttut nassuiarnissaa ajornannginneruvoq.

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:19.510
Pingaaruteqarpoq ineriartortitsisut domæne-mik ilisimasallit pisariaqartitaannik upperinnillutik malinnaanissaq, kisianni...

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.430
Suliniut tamaat eqqarsaatigalugu

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:23.930
Aamma akisussaaffigaarput suliassat pitsaasumik ingerlatsinissaannut.

00:07:25.850 --> 00:07:27.760
Suliniummut aqqimik aalajangersimaguit

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:31.380
Maanna piffissanngorpoq paasiniarlugu kikkut Filminik Inniminniinermik Systemimik atuisarnersut.

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:34.940
Soorunami tamanna pillugu paasissutissanik domain-imik ilisimasalimmut aperisariaqarpat.

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:38.740
Aammalu paasivagut ataasiakkaanik aqutsisunillu peqartugut.

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:43.280
Niuernerup siulliup nalaani ajornanngitsumik misigineqarsinnaasut ilaat tassaavoq

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:44.760
Tassaavoq avataaniit apeqqutaaneq

00:07:45.340 --> 00:07:46.580
Avatangiisinut tunngasut tassaapput

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:49.210
Tassaasinnaavoq legacy systemi pioreersoq,

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:51.420
Tassaasinnaavoq akiliisarfiit

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:53.670
Tamanna dependence-mik ataqatigiinneq tassaavoq

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:56.760
Pissutigalugu systemip tamakkerlugu sananeqarneranut annertuumik sunniuteqarsinnaammat.

00:07:56.950 --> 00:08:00.150
Pingaaruteqarpoq sapinngisamik siusinnerusukkut tunniussinissaq.

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:01.240
ajoraluartumik

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:04.990
Pissutsit soorlu akiliisarfiit aamma systemit siulliit

00:08:05.270 --> 00:08:07.730
Pissutigalugu systemini pioreersuni atorneqalereermat

00:08:07.990 --> 00:08:10.360
Taanna assut ajornanngitsumik paasineqarsinnaavoq

00:08:11.230 --> 00:08:14.410
Ilaatigut dependentimik aappariinnermi ajornanngitsumik eqqarsaatigineqarsinnaasoq tassaavoq

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:16.090
Avatangiisinut tunngasut tassaapput

00:08:16.900 --> 00:08:19.060
Nunarput nalunaaquttap ingerlanerani taamaallaat inissisimavoq

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:22.430
Nunami nunap immikkoortuani angisuumi isiginnaartitsisarfiit ataasiakkaat piffissaq assigiinngitsoq atortarpaat.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:25.100
Taava Filminik Inniminniinermut Systemi

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:28.900
Avatangiisinut tunngasunik soorlu piffissap ingerlanerani sunniuteqarnissaa pinngitsoorneqarsinnaanngilaq.

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:32.760
Pissutsit taakku erseqqissumik takuneqarsinnaanngillat, domain-imi immikkut ilisimasalimmut toqqaannartumik aperinngikkuit.

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:33.950
Ajornanngilaq misigissallugu

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:37.610
Domæne-mik ilisimasallit taakku kisitsisit puigortarpaat.

00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:40.010
Pissutigalugu nassuiaat ilanngunneqarsinnaammat

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:43.640
Taamaattumik dependency-mik ataqatigiinneq ersarissumik oqaatigineqarmat

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:47.500
Maanna Filminik Booking Systemip iluani pingaarnertut sammisaqarpugut.

00:08:48.430 --> 00:08:52.230
Siullermik Film Booking Systemimi ataasiakkaaq qanoq iliortarpa?

00:08:52.230 --> 00:08:54.230
Domæne-mik ilisimasallit apeqqutigissavagut

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.880
Ataasiakkaat qanoq iliortarpat?

00:08:57.880 --> 00:08:59.970
Ataasiakkaat filminik ujaasipput,

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:01.450
Filmip kisitsisit takukkit,

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:02.910
Piffissaq takutinneqartussaq toqqaruk,

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:04.450
Issiaviit toqqaruk,

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:05.920
Filmimut billetsinik inniminniisoqarsinnaavoq,

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:07.610
Inniminniinermut paasissutissat takukkit,

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:10.180
Soorlu inniminniinermik unitsitsineq suliariuk

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:15.750
Takutitsiffissaq toqqarnissaa aamma issiavimmik toqqaanissaq filmimut billetsinik inniminniinermut ilaapput?

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:18.880
Aamma filmimut billetsinik inniminniinissaq, inniminniinerit unitsinnissaat

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:22.210
Soorunami billetsimik pisisarneq aningaasanillu taarsiiffigineqarneq ajorpit?

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:23.620
illit eqqorpit

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:25.030
Tassa taamaappoq

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:27.880
Pissutigalugu maanna ilisimaneqarluartoq

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:31.240
Piffissaq takutinneqartussaq toqqaruk aammalu issiaviit toqqarlugit

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:33.200
Tamanna filmimut billetsinut inniminniinermut ilaavoq?

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:34.530
Aperisinnaavunga

00:09:34.980 --> 00:09:37.220
Kisianni ilisimaneqanngitsumik domæne-uppat,

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:40.160
Atorneqarnerit ataasiakkaat sukumiisumik misissoqqissaarlugit

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:43.330
Arlaleriarlutit raffinerineq uteqqissavat.

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:45.350
Suliniummi qanoq inissisimaneq apeqqutaatillugu

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:48.080
Suliaq tamanna arlaleriarlutit uteqqissinnaavat,

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:50.580
Piffissaq atorlugu peqqissaartumik misissueqqissaartarpat,

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:54.190
Niuernermi atuutilersitsinermilu misileraaneq kukkunerlu annikillisikkit.

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:57.530
Manna tikillugu oqaloqatigiinneq aallaavigalugu

00:09:57.530 --> 00:10:00.970
Atuisut atuinerput sisamanut immikkoortortarsimavarput:

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:04.470
Taava tassaavoq aqutsisoq

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:08.850
Administratorip takusinnaavaa aqutsinermi pissutsit pingasut:

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:13.620
Uanga nammineq oqaaseq "Manage" ineriartortitsinermi atorneqarnissaanut mianersoqquvunga.

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.980
Manage tassaavoq oqaaseq annertoorujussuaq

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:19.030
Nalunarpoq qanoq iliornersutit

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:20.950
Maani aamma taamaappoq

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:23.760
Qanoq eqqortumik aqunneqartarpa?

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:24.810
Naluara

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:27.620
Domæne-mik ilisimasallit oqaloqatiginerisigut

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:31.220
Aqutsinermi atortut ataasiakkaat immikkut ittumik atuinermut annertusarneqarput.

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.660
Ilumut projektiuppat

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:35.890
Tamatuma saniatigut atuinerit amerlanerupput.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:39.000
Uani nassuiaatissatut piuminarsarpara.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.700
Uani maluginiassagipput pingaaruteqartoq tassaavoq, ingerlaarfiusumik pilersitsisoqarpat,

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:45.900
Takusinnaavat billetsi aamma pilersinneqartoq

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:49.200
Aammalu billetsimik pisiniarnermi imaluunniit taarsiiffiginninnermi

00:10:49.490 --> 00:10:53.910
Aamma takusinnaavat avataaniit sullissineq akiliisarfimmik taaneqartartoq atortarparput.

00:10:55.890 --> 00:10:58.670
Ataasiakkaat aamma aqutsisut atuinerat ataatsimoortippara.

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:01.730
Use case tamakkerlugu qiviaraanni taamatut

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:02.900
Suliaq imaannaanngitsoq misigivoq

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.840
Teaterimik ilanngussaqarnissaq periarfissaqarpoq

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:08.720
Uanga Search Theatre-tut ittumik takusaqanngilanga

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:12.130
Sunaaffa arlalinnik use case-inik atornerluisoqartartoq.

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:15.980
Pissutigalugu domæne-mik ilisimasalik isigalugu nassuiaatissaqartorujussuuvoq.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.950
Una atuineq, taama erseqqissutut isigineqartoq,

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.810
Nassuiaat ilanngussinnaavat

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:23.460
Taava ineriartortitsisup isiginnittaasianit sunagooq?

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:28.290
Pitsaaneruvoq tusagassiuutit ajornanngitsut soorlu isiginnaartitsisarfimmik ujaasineq unitsissallugit.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:30.700
Tamanna allakkianik aqutsinermut iluaqutaanerussannginnerpa?

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:32.870
Backend-imik suliaqarneq tassaappat

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:35.920
Atorneqarsinnaasut ajornanngitsut soorlu isiginnaartitsisarfimmik ujarlerneq

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.760
Isumaqarpunga skip-ernissaq ajunngitsoq

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:41.570
Oqaatigisara tassaavoq atuutsinneqarnerata nalaani akissuteqarnissaq kingusippallaanngitsoq.

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:44.310
Kisianni ilumut projektiuppat

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:48.450
Skærmimik pilersaarusiortunut atuinerit taakku aallartiffiulluarsinnaapput.

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:52.300
Pilersaarusiortup isiginnaartitsisarfimmik ujaasinermi atuineq qiviarpaa.

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:55.300
Isiginnaartitsisarfinnik ujaasisinnaaneq qanoq periarfissinneqartariaqarpa?

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:56.600
Eqqarsarsinnaassaatit

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:00.880
Diagrammit ataatsimoortillugit ataatsimoortillugit, taava pissanganartutut isikkoqarpoq.

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:05.150
Ilumoortumik suliniuteqarsimagaluarpat, taava annertuumik ajornakusoorsinnaagaluarpoq.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:08.240
Tassa ataatsimoortitsinissaq pinngitsoorniarlugu pisariaqanngilaq.

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:13.910
Uani aatsaat ataatsimoortippakka, paasiniarlugu suliassanik amigaateqartoqartoq.

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:18.490
Suliassat amigaatigineqartut tamarmik immerpakka

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:21.880
Uanga use case-eqarpunga, tassani isiginnaartitsisartumut attaveqarneq ilanngunneqanngilaq.

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:25.720
Tamanna atuisunut aamma aqutsisunut atuuppoq.

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:29.480
Aammalu atuutilersinneqarnissaa ajornannginnerulersinniarlugu tuluttut allappara.

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:34.160
Maanna ajunngilaq pissutigalugu suliassaq mikisoq

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:36.160
Suliniut annertuujuppat aammalu ajornakusoorpat

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:38.980
Domæne-mik ilisimasalik sumi nassuiaateqalertariaqarpa?

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:40.380
Ajornartorsiutaasinnaavoq

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.300
Administratori qanoq iliortarpa?

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:44.700
Suliassaqartorujussuuvoq

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.620
Soorlu pisortamit naatsorsuutigineqartoq

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.750
Tassani isiginnaartitsisartut immikkoortitersinnaavagut?

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:52.340
Aamma nalilersuinissaq isumassarsiatsialaavoq

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:54.790
Aallaqqaammut administratoritut taaneqartarpunga

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:57.400
Rolle malillugu immikkoortitsisoqarsinnaavoq

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:00.820
Aammalu Filminik Inniminniinermut Systemi atorlugu

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:02.870
Avataaniit sullissisoqarsinnaavoq

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.340
Isiginnaartitsisut taamatut segmenterpagut,

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:09.420
Domæne-mik ilisimasallit systematiskiusumik paasissutissanik tunniussisinnaassapput.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:14.000
Soorunami tamanna domænemik annertuumik misissueqqissaarnissamut assersuutissaavoq.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:17.320
Allanik pitsaasunik aqqutissaqarsinnaavoq

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:21.740
Pingaaruteqarpoq pissutsit apeqqutaallutik tamatigoortumik akissuteqarnissaq.

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:25.060
Taamatut inerniliisoqarpoq

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:29.170
Taamaalilluni atuinermut diagrammi atorniarparput

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:30.840
Suliniummut anguniagassat aalajangersarlugit

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:33.700
Misissuinerup siulliup nalaani ingerlasimavunga.

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:38.010
Personligt, ineriartortitsinerup nalaani tamakkerlugu

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:40.060
Isumaqarpunga misissuineq ajornerpaaq

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:44.250
Pissutigalugu isumassarsiat abstrakterepaat aammalu eqqortuunngitsut aaqqissuuttariaqarpagut.

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:47.650
Tulliani pingaarnertut atorneqartut qiviassavagut

00:13:47.650 --> 00:13:49.470
Taanna sukumiinerusumik misissoriartigu

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.100
Manna tikillugu sulilluarsimanersi pillugu qujanaq.

